          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Shri Nilesh requested one of the staff members to bring the sweets as given in the table. The above table helped him to purchase the correct numbers of sweets."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.196,
            0.833,
            0.261
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Is the above table sufficient to distribute each type of sweet to the correct student? Explain. If it is not sufficient, what is the alternative?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.289,
            0.821,
            0.376
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "To organise the data, we can write the name of each sweet in one column and using tally signs, note the number of students who prefer that sweet. The numbers 6, 9, … are the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "frequencies",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of the sweet preferences for jalebi, gulab jamun … respectively."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.396,
            0.832,
            0.441
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Sushri Sandhya asked her students about the sizes of the shoes they wear. She noted the data on the board."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
